se randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nRural doctor Zhang Hua always believes that traditional Chinese medicine is the best method to treat all diseases. Urban doctor Li Jun, who works with him, hopes to convince him to recognize the importance of the combination of Chinese and Western medicine.\n\n[Question]\nHow does Li Jun convince Zhang Hua?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Li Jun can explain the scientific theory behind Western medical treatment methods and why combining with Chinese medicine can optimize treatment plans by showing some research papers.\nB. Li Jun can share some successful cases, showing that the combination of Chinese and Western medicine brings better treatment effects.\nC. Introduce the recognition and promotion of the combination of Chinese and Western medicine by international organizations such as the World Health Organization.\nD. Organize some well-known doctors in the field of Chinese and Western medicine combination to give lectures and exchange experiences with Zhang Hua.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.001926682141405704,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e1ddd6006945d2800b46","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367965055,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:32:45","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"87f2802d01874870975adee00dc14b84"}